# HealthTwin Flask App — Walkthrough

## What Was Built

Recreated the entire HealthTwin application in Flask with a comprehensive health history dashboard and user login system.

## Project Structure

```
healthtwin/
├── flask_app/
│   ├── __init__.py          # Flask factory + blueprint registration
│   ├── user_model.py        # Flask-Login UserMixin
│   ├── database.py          # SQLite helpers (users + health_logs)
│   ├── auth.py              # Login / Register / Logout blueprint
│   ├── health.py            # Dashboard, analyze, save_log, history, AI advisor
│   ├── predictions.py       # Diabetes / Heart / Parkinson's prediction routes
│   ├── chatbot.py           # AI chatbot blueprint
│   ├── ml_models.py         # Risk classifiers + health score + disease models
│   └── ai_advisor.py        # Rule-based health advisor
├── templates/
│   ├── base.html            # Layout with navigation (auth-aware)
│   ├── login.html           # Login page with password toggle
│   ├── register.html        # Registration page
│   ├── index.html           # Landing page
│   ├── dashboard.html       # ⭐ Main dashboard (Charts.js history charts + AI advisor)
│   ├── history.html         # ⭐ Full history page with 6 charts + stats
│   ├── diabetes.html        # Diabetes prediction form
│   ├── heart.html           # Heart disease prediction form
│   ├── parkinsons.html      # Parkinson's prediction form
│   ├── watch.html           # Smartwatch simulation
│   └── chatbot.html         # AI chat interface
├── static_flask/
│   ├── css/styles.css       # Premium dark UI with glassmorphism + animations
│   └── js/
│       ├── app.js           # Flash message auto-dismiss
│       └── predict.js       # Shared prediction form handler
└── run.py                   # Entry point → python run.py
```

## How to Run

```powershell
