## Dashboard Health History Features

The dashboard page (`/dashboard`) and history page (`/history`) show **6 interactive Chart.js charts**:

| Chart | Metric |
|-------|--------|
| 🏆 Health Score | Your overall score over time |
| ⚖️ BMI | BMI trend over time |
| 👟 Daily Steps | Step count history |
| 😴 Sleep Hours | Sleep pattern tracking |
| 💧 Water Intake | Hydration history |
| ❤️ Heart Rate | Resting heart rate trend |

## Pages & Routes

| Route | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| `/` | Landing page |
| `/login` | Login (username + password) |
| `/register` | Create new account |
| `/dashboard` | Main health dashboard + charts + AI advisor |
| `/history` | Full history page with charts + stats summary |
| `/diabetes` | Diabetes risk prediction |
| `/heart` | Heart disease detection |
| `/parkinsons` | Parkinson's analysis |
| `/watch` | Smartwatch simulation |
| `/chatbot` | AI health chat assistant |
| `/logout` | Logout |

